NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

This license covers the SOURCE CODE only. It does NOT cover any model weights.

No model weights are distributed in this repository. Every checkpoint is
downloaded at runtime by the setup scripts from its official source, and each
one carries its own license — for example RMBG-2.0 is non-commercial, while
FLUX.2-klein-4B is Apache-2.0. Check each model's own license before use.
